# Paths (relative to your home folder) that omarchy-desktop owns: install.sh
# copies them from home/ in this repo, updates replace them, and the
# maintainer's `omarchy-desktop capture` copies them back in. A trailing /
# means the whole folder (files dropped upstream are removed on update).
# Everything else in your home folder is yours and is never touched.


.config/omarchy/selfcheck
.config/omarchy/hooks/post-update.d/desktop-selfcheck.hook
.config/omarchy/setup-system
.local/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/teams.png
.local/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/youtube-music.png
